// Polls that found the job worker had been away from a tenant past the gap threshold.
// Backs the "the worker came back from a long absence" alert: a restored backup or a long outage.
// The overdue work was held rather than run, and waits for an administrator to resume or cancel it
// on the Jobs page; any detection needs a person.
customMetrics
| where name == "tellma.schedules.gap_detected"
| summarize gaps = sum(valueSum) by cloud_RoleInstance, bin(timestamp, 5m)
| where gaps > 0
